        <h2 class="fb-h2" style="color:#fff;">Three stages, one small habit.</h2>
        <p>The guide breaks the first month into stages, so you always know what to focus on this week.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="fb-roadmap-grid">
        {%- comment -%} Stage 1 {%- endcomment -%}
        <article class="fb-stage-card">
          <div class="fb-stage-top">
