              <span class="fb-stage-range">Days 1–7</span>
              <span class="fb-stage-name">The reset</span>
            </div>
            <div class="fb-heatmap" aria-hidden="true">
              {%- for d in (1..30) -%}<span style="background:{% if d < 1 %}#47B5E9{% elsif d <= 7 %}#13B6B5{% else %}#EAF6FD{% endif %};"></span>{%- endfor -%}
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="fb-stage-block"><span class="fb-stage-label">What you do</span><p>Pick one time each day (the book suggests evening, after the last meal). Start with the front teeth only, and follow every session with a treat.</p></div>
          <div class="fb-stage-block"><span class="fb-stage-label">What you learn</span><p>The five steps, how to lift the lip without a struggle, and how to read your dog's comfort as you go a little further back each day.</p></div>
        </article>
        {%- comment -%} Stage 2 {%- endcomment -%}
        <article class="fb-stage-card">
          <div class="fb-stage-top">
            <div class="fb-stage-meta">
              <span class="fb-stage-kicker">Stage 2</span>
              <span class="fb-stage-range">Days 8–21</span>
              <span class="fb-stage-name">The shift</span>
            </div>
